@startuml timeline-vfx-density
' SPEC: _spec/apps/starchess/architecture/timeline-vfx-density.puml
' purpose: Shipped compositor relief — paint-property audit, phase-ring overlay, review caps.
!include ../../../themes/proveo.puml

skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title StarChess · VFX density / compositor\npaint-animation audit · phase ring · review caps

package "Inputs" {
  database "timeline()\nCombatCueFrame" as TL <<db>>
  component "vfxDensity → capForDensity\nfull | review" as DEN <<host>>
}

package "Filter pipeline" {
  component "capCues + trail caps\n(vfxPerf · density-aware limits)" as CAP <<async>>
  component "paint-property audit\noutline-color · border-*-color · box-shadow\n→ transform/opacity | static + opacity" as PAINT <<async>>
}

package "Render" {
  component "CombatOverlayRoot\nlayers always mounted\nempty = NO_* stables" as ROOT <<app>>
  component "GasDropAnimation\n.aura static outline + glow\nopacity-only keyframes" as GAS <<app>>
  component "StarChessBoard\n.board-phase-ring overlay\nopacity-only fade · data-phase" as BOARD <<app>>
  component "GPU / CSS Animations\ntransform+opacity preferred" as GPU <<cloud>>
}

TL ARROW_MAIN CAP
DEN ARROW_MAIN CAP : tighter limits
CAP ARROW_MAIN ROOT : capped cue lists
TL ARROW_OPTIONAL BOARD : hide / display* only
ROOT ARROW_MAIN GAS
ROOT ARROW_MAIN GPU
GAS ARROW_MAIN GPU : opacity only
BOARD ARROW_MAIN GPU
PAINT ARROW_OPTIONAL GAS : no paint-only props
PAINT ARROW_OPTIONAL BOARD : ring fade = opacity only
PAINT ARROW_OPTIONAL ROOT : no paint-only @keyframes

note right of PAINT
  **audit:** @keyframes / transition on paint-only
  properties (outline-color · border-*-color ·
  box-shadow) repaint every frame → move to
  transform/opacity, or pay paint once and fade
  opacity (gas .aura · .board-phase-ring).
end note

note bottom
  **Do not:** per-layer Show (CSS restart) · contain:paint on overflow root ·
  second clock · change cue math · transition / @keyframes on paint-only
  properties (outline-color · border-*-color · box-shadow).
  **Rejected:** fog-cull of hidden leaves — the review perf case has no fog.
  **Measured (…105537):** DroppedFrame **330 (8% of baseline 4045) — met**;
  GPU main busy **8.3s** (was ~39s); paint max 0.88ms. Paint/s · Commit/s ·
  Swap/s doubled — cheap frames, not a regression signal in vsync-off env.
  **Shipped:** fragShockwave border-color → two-ring opacity cross-fade.
  **P2:** .pieceSpecialUsed outline
  (30ms hotspot, accepted) · optional-FX drop.
  Parent design: ""timeline-perf.puml"".
end note

@enduml
